The answer is A: site carrying capacity.

71
00:05:43.283 --> 00:05:46.293
By next year, she blank here for a decade.

72
00:05:46.593 --> 00:05:50.571
A, will have been working. B, will work. C, works.

73
00:05:54.583 --> 00:05:57.326
The answer is A: will have been working.

74
00:05:58.817 --> 00:06:01.269
By 2030, the project blank.

75
00:06:01.569 --> 00:06:06.267
A, will have been finished. B, will have been finishing. C, finishes.

76
00:06:10.283 --> 00:06:12.840
The answer is A: will have been finished.

77
00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:17.952
Local people taking responsibility for a place is blank.

78
00:06:18.252 --> 00:06:24.425
A, community stewardship. B, authenticity debate. C, heritage tourism.

